  "title": "Headed to Bio-IT World? Join the CFDE Training Center at the Bio-IT World Hackathon!",
  "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>Join the CFDE Training Center at the Bio-IT World Hackathon!&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>? </strong>May 18 – 19, 2026 in Boston, MA</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>Are you interested in integrating multi-omics, structural, and network-based approaches to unlock new discoveries?</strong></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">This event will foster open learning, collaboration, and problem-solving, leaving participants engaged and energized for future data use.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>Cash prizes awarded to winning teams!</strong></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">The hackathon is free and in-person only. Registration to the main conference is not required. </span><a style=\"color:rgb(17, 85, 204);\" href=\"https://www.bio-itworldexpo.com/fair-data-hackathon\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.bio-itworldexpo.com/fair-data-hackathon&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1773249818842000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0vEFabhHoxmUcC-QueUocE\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">https://www.bio-itworldexpo.<wbr>com/fair-data-hackathon</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Hackathon%20Promotion_SM.png\" width=\"745\" height=\"1024\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b004b136-c8f9-47a6-b7ae-59260044edb0\" al